      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is very important that you discuss this with your prescribing doctor immediately. Vitamin K directly interacts with how warfarin works, and taking supplements alongside it can significantly alter your blood-thinning levels. Because of this potential for dangerous interactions, you should not adjust your dose or take the supplement without medical guidance.",
