      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You should never attempt to monitor this interaction or adjust doses based on how you \"feel.\" Warfarin management requires consistent, precise monitoring, usually through INR testing, which assesses your actual clotting time. Self-adjusting either medication or supplement places you at serious risk for uncontrolled bleeding or blood clots. Please call your doctor's office again and explain that you need urgent guidance on this specific drug interaction.",
      "source": "target",
